sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Your application
    participant Engine as RetrievalEngine
    participant Ingest as IngestionService
    participant Store as Metadata store
    participant Round as Lifecycle round
    participant Units as Index units

    App->>Engine: ingest(documents, scope)
    Engine->>Engine: authorize · validate limits
    Engine->>Ingest: documents
    Ingest->>Ingest: canonicalize · content hash<br/>derive chunks, sections, graph contributions
    Ingest->>Store: write transaction per chunk of up to 200 documents<br/>document · version · representations · objects · event
    Note over Ingest,Store: Identical content is reported as unchanged,<br/>a redelivered event as replayed.
    Engine->>Round: run a round for the scope
    Round->>Store: pending coverage since the unit watermark
    Round->>Units: write new objects, remove superseded ones<br/>(or build and publish a new generation)
    Round->>Store: coverage ready · version visible
    Engine-->>App: IngestReport<br/>created · updated · unchanged · revived · replayed
